[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0605","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1484","title":"DB4Web 连接代理漏洞","description":"DB4Web 服务器在开启详细调试消息（verbose debug messages）配置时存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含任意目标 IP 地址和端口的特制 URL 请求，利用 DB4Web 作为代理向其他系统发起 TCP 连接，通过返回的错误消息中的连接状态信息判断目标主机的端口开放情况，从而实现端口扫描和内网探测。该漏洞影响 DB4Web 3.4 和 3.6 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者仅需通过网络向目标服务器发送恶意请求即可利用此漏洞，无需任何身份认证或交互权限，成功利用可导致攻击者绕过网络边界，对内网服务进行探测。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1484"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"升级 DB4Web 至厂商发布的最新可用修复版本，并在服务器配置文件中关闭详细调试消息（verbose debug）选项。若厂商未发布修复补丁，应在防火墙中阻断 DB4Web 服务器的出站 TCP 连接，仅允许访问后端数据库的必要端口，同时将 DB4Web 部署于隔离网段并严格限制访问来源 IP，或迁移至受支持的数据库管理工具（如 Adminer）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0201.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0125.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10136.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21801","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1484.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1484.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1484.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1484.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1484","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1484.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/a4e6f7600554ac8403f3ff05bd1db846165cce29/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-1484.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1484.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1484.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1484.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0604","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1483","title":"DB4Web 3.4/3.6 文件泄漏漏洞","description":"DB4Web 3.4 和 3.6 版本中的 db4web_c 及 db4web_c.exe 程序存在路径遍历文件泄漏漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，在请求参数中使用以盘符（如 C:）、双斜杠绝对路径（如 //absolute/path）或点号序列（如 ..）等形式指定文件名，从而绕过目录访问限制，读取目标服务器上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 DB4Web 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需登录凭据即可发起利用。成功利用可能导致敏感配置文件、源代码或系统文件泄露，造成信息安全隐患。攻击者仅需向目标 Web 服务器发送单次特制 HTTP 请求即可完成利用，利用门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1483"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"立即应用 DB4Web 官方补丁：访问 http://www.db4web.de/download/homepage/hotfix/readme_en.txt 下载并安装针对 3.4/3.6 版本的安全补丁，修复 db4web_c 及 db4web_c.exe 中的目录遍历漏洞。如补丁无法获取，应在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/IIS）的配置中对 db4web_c 和 db4web_c.exe 脚本所在路径实施访问控制，仅允许来自内部可信网络的请求，并阻止包含 \"C:\"、双斜杠 \"//\" 及多级点号 \"..\" 的请求参数通过。同时建议在网络边界部署 WAF 规则拦截包含目录遍历特征的 URL 请求。长期应评估迁移至受支持的数据库 Web 管理工具，因为 DB4Web 厂商已停止运营且版本过时。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0197.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0124.html","http://www.db4web.de/download/homepage/hotfix/readme_en.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10123.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5723","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21800","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1483","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2002/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1483.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1483.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2002-1483.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0604.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0603","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1482","title":"phpGB 1.x login.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"phpGB 是一个 PHP 留言板程序。login.php 文件在 phpGB 1.20 及更早版本中存在 SQL 注入漏洞，当服务器的 PHP 配置中 magic_quotes_gpc 选项未开启时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在登录界面的密码输入字段中注入恶意 SQL 代码，从而绕过身份验证机制并获得管理员权限。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 phpGB 的网站，攻击条件要求目标服务器未启用 magic_quotes_gpc 功能，攻击者只需构造包含 SQL 语句的特制密码即可完成利用，无需任何身份凭证或前置交互。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1482"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"建议立即将 phpGB 升级至官方发布的最新修复版本。如暂无法立即升级，应在 PHP 配置文件中启用 magic_quotes_gpc 指令作为临时缓解措施，并修改 login.php 对用户密码输入使用 addslashes() 或 mysql_real_escape_string() 函数进行转义处理后再执行 SQL 查询，防止攻击者通过 SQL 注入获取管理员权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0076.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10068.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5673","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21778","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1482","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2002/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1482.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1482.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1482.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0603.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0603.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0602","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1481","title":"PHPGB 1.1/1.2 PHP 代码执行漏洞","description":"phpGB 1.20 及更早版本中的 savesettings.php 脚本存在 PHP 代码注入漏洞。该脚本未对访问者进行身份认证，攻击者无需账号凭据即可直接调用 savesettings.php 修改配置文件 config.php，通过在请求中注入任意 PHP 代码实现远程代码执行，或通过篡改配置导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响所有使用 phpGB 1.1/1.2/1.20 及以下版本的留言板系统，攻击者只需通过网络向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求即可完成利用，利用门槛极低且无需交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高危。攻击者可完全控制受影响的 Web 服务器，造成数据泄露、网站篡改或服务器被进一步入侵等严重后果。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1481"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 phpGB 至 1.21 或更高版本，该版本已修复 savesettings.php 的身份验证绕过漏洞。如暂无法升级，应立即删除或禁用 admin/savesettings.php 文件，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache .htaccess 或 Nginx location 规则）限制仅允许本地访问该文件。同时将 config.php 的文件权限设为只读（chmod 444），防止 Web 进程写入修改。若 guestbook 功能非必需，建议直接下线该应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0076.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10065.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5679","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21783","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1481","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b3f4c2d3415c65726be0117ea27f8235b2a3446a/2002/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1481.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1481.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1481.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0602.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0602.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0602.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0601","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0601.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1480","title":"phpGB 留言本系统 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"phpGB 1.20 之前版本存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞，由于对用户输入缺乏严格的过滤和转义，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以在留言板页面中提交包含恶意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本代码的留言。当网站管理员在后台删除该留言条目时，注入的恶意脚本会在管理员的浏览器中执行。该漏洞影响所有使用 phpGB 1.20 及之前版本的网站，攻击者借此可窃取管理员会话 Cookie、执行未授权操作或进一步控制网站后台，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1480"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 phpGB 至 1.20 或更高版本，该版本修复了删除条目时的 XSS 漏洞。若暂时无法升级，请在代码层面对留言内容实施 HTML 实体编码转义（如使用 htmlspecialchars()），并在管理员删除操作前严格过滤用户输入的脚本标签，同时建议部署 WAF 拦截恶意脚本注入请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0069.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10060.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5676","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21780","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1480","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a293285bf198645eacfa1fb6bdd6757780626e5/2002/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1480.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1480.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1480.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0601.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0601.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0600","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1473","title":"HP-UX LPD 缓冲区溢出命令执行漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 至 11.11（11i）版本的 lp 子系统存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过向打印服务发送特制数据触发缓冲区溢出，造成拒绝服务，并可能执行任意代码提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.20、11.00 和 11.11 等主流版本，CVSS 评分为 4.6（MEDIUM），攻击条件要求攻击者具有本地访问权限。目前已存在 Metasploit 模块可对此漏洞进行利用，建议升级至 HP 官方发布的安全补丁版本以修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1473"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:23Z","remediation":"建议升级至 HP-UX 11.11i (September 2003) 或更高版本，并安装 HP 官方补丁 PHSS_29543 (HP-UX 11.00) 或 PHSS_29544 (HP-UX 11.11)。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 LPD 服务：执行 /usr/sbin/lpshut 停止打印服务，并在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 printer 行后重启 inetd。同时限制本地用户权限，移除非必要的 lp 组成员。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2002-q3/0064.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9992.php","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10034","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1473.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1473.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1473.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1473","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1473.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1473.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1473.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2002/CVE-2002-1473.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1473.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1473.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0599","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1469","title":"scponly SSH 环境变量注入访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"scponly 是一个限制用户仅使用 scp 和 sftp 命令的受限 Shell，但其在定位 scp 和 sftp-server 程序时未正确验证路径。已认证的远程攻击者可通过上传恶意程序并修改 $HOME/.ssh/environment 文件中的 PATH 环境变量，使系统定位到攻击者上传的恶意程序而非合法的 scp/sftp-server，从而绕过 scponly 的访问控制限制，在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SCPOnly 2.3 和 2.4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需额外身份认证即可利用，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性均受到破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1469"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:23Z","remediation":"立即将 scponly 升级至 2.4 或更高版本（推荐 4.0 以上），新版本已修复对 scp 和 sftp-server 程序路径的验证缺陷。对于已部署的系统，执行以下临时缓解措施：以 root 身份将受限用户的 home 目录及 .ssh 子目录所有权改为 root.root 并设为不可变（chown root.root ~scpuser ~scpuser/.ssh && chattr +i ~scpuser ~scpuser/.ssh），禁止直接向 home 目录上传文件，改为创建 incoming 专用目录（mkdir ~scpuser/incoming && chown scpuser.scpuser ~scpuser/incoming），并全面审计及清除 home 目录中已有的所有隐藏文件（dotfiles），防止攻击者通过修改 $HOME/.ssh/environment 中的 PATH 变量绕过访问控制。同时在 sshd_config 中设置 PermitUserEnvironment no 以禁用用户环境文件加载，重启 sshd 服务生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/288245","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9913.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5526","http://www.sublimation.org/scponly/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21732","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1469","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2002/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1469.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/89fbba38c2d6be5ae7165c8ae7c8f3c0641ea56f/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1469.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1469.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0598","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1468","title":"IBM AIX ERRPT 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.3.x 和 5.1 操作系统中的 errpt 错误报告工具存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。该工具在处理用户传入的超长命令行参数时未对缓冲区边界进行有效校验，本地攻击者可通过构造特制的参数触发溢出并覆写栈上返回地址。成功利用该漏洞后，攻击者能够在受影响系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.3.x 及 5.1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。攻击者需具备目标系统的本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞，公开利用代码已通过设置环境变量并调用 errpt 命令的方式实现权限提升。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1468"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:23Z","remediation":"立即安装包含 errpt 安全修复的 IBM AIX 5.2 或 5.3 版本，或将系统升级至应用了解决 errpt 缓冲区溢漏洞的授权修正程序 (APAR) IY34119。升级后，系统将应用增强的安全验证机制以防止 errpt 命令的缓冲区溢出攻击。如无法立即升级，可通过 `/etc/security/user` 修改账户权限，限制对 errpt 命令的使用权限，并部署文件完整性检查工具监控 errpt 二进制文件的完整性变化。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/aix/2002-q3/0007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5885","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1468","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2002/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1468.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1468.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1468.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0388","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0388.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1467","title":"Macromedia Flash Player 安全绕过任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Macromedia Flash Player 6.0.47.0 之前版本存在同源策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过以下三种方式绕过同域限制并读取任意文件：(1) 利用 HTTP 重定向；(2) 在 Web 文档中设置 \"file://\" 协议的基础 URL；(3) 从 Web 存档（mht 文件）中使用相对 URL。该漏洞影响安装了 Flash Player 及 Shockwave 插件的所有浏览器，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，导致敏感文件信息泄露。Adobe 已在 Flash Player 6.0.47.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1467"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:22Z","remediation":"升级 Macromedia Flash Player 至 6.0.47.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过 HTTP 重定向、file:// 协议及 .mht 文件绕过同源策略读取任意文件的问题。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件或使用 ActiveX 筛选功能阻止 Flash 内容加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/286625","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9797.php","http://www.macromedia.com/v1/handlers/index.cfm?ID=23294","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5429","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2007/CVE-2007-5275.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1467.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1467","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1467.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2007/CVE-2007-5275.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1467.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1467.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2002/CVE-2002-1467.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1467.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1467.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0388.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0098","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1479","title":"Raxnet Cacti 配置文件敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cacti 0.6.8 之前版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，其 config.php 文件以明文存储 MySQL 数据库用户名和密码，且该文件权限设置为全局可读（world-readable）。本地攻击者可通过读取该配置文件获取数据库凭据，进而以 Cacti 用户身份修改数据库内容，可能导致权限提升或数据篡改。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需拥有目标系统的本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1479"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"升级 Cacti 至 0.6.8 或更高版本，该版本已修复 config.php 中明文存储 MySQL 密码的问题。升级后执行 chmod 640 config.php 限制配置文件权限仅允许 Web 用户和 root 读取，并修改 MySQL 账户密码。如无法升级，立即执行 chmod 640 config.php 并移除文件中的数据库密码，改用环境变量或受限配置文件存储凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0028.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10049.php","http://www.knights-of-the-routing-table.org/advisories/krt_001_20020903_cacti.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5628","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1479.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1479","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1479.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1479.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-389p-g5q7-wj2f/GHSA-389p-g5q7-wj2f.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/Raxnet%20Cacti%E5%85%A8%E5%9F%9F%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%BBConfig.php%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2002-1479).html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146900_147000.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5628/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2556abde251deb45ab54cda4e6be13bd9350b483/2002/CVE-2002-1479.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0097","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1478","title":"Raxnet Cacti 控制台命令执行漏洞","description":"Cacti 网络流量监控系统 0.6.8 之前版本的控制台模式中存在命令执行漏洞。具有控制台访问权限的攻击者可通过在\"Data Input\"（数据输入）选项中注入恶意系统命令，利用该漏洞在服务器上以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意命令，进而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Cacti 0.6.8 之前所有版本，攻击者只需拥有控制台登录权限即可触发，无需其他特殊条件，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1478"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"立即将 Cacti 升级至 0.6.8 或更高版本。Debian 系统可参考 DSA-164 安全公告安装更新包。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 Cacti 控制台管理页面的访问 IP，并禁用未授权的 Data Input 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0028.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-164","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10050.php","http://www.knights-of-the-routing-table.org/advisories/krt_001_20020903_cacti.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1478.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1478","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1478.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1478.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/Raxnet%20Cacti%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%B0%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2002-1478).html","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-164.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2v8j-4895-h2g9/GHSA-2v8j-4895-h2g9.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-164.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146900_147000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0096","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1477","title":"Raxnet Cacti 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cacti 网络监控系统 0.6.8 之前版本的 graphs.php 文件中存在命令注入漏洞，具有管理员权限的远程认证用户可在编辑模式下通过标题字段注入 shell 元字符，导致任意命令执行。攻击者需先获取 Cacti 管理后台的合法凭据，成功利用后可完全控制目标服务器，窃取敏感数据或横向移动。该漏洞影响 Cacti 0.6.8 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已在 0.6.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1477"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24Z","remediation":"升级 Cacti 至 0.6.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 graphs.php 中 title 参数未正确过滤 shell 元字符的问题。如无法升级，限制仅信任的管理员账号可访问编辑功能，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面过滤 title 参数中的 `;`、`|`、`&`、`$` 等 shell 特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0028.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-164","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10048.php","http://www.knights-of-the-routing-table.org/advisories/krt_001_20020903_cacti.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5627","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1477.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1477","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1477.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1477.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/Raxnet%20Cacti%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2002-1477).html","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-164.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-89r6-x49c-h6w2/GHSA-89r6-x49c-h6w2.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-164.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146900_147000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0095","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1471","title":"Ximian Evolution SSL证书验证绕过漏洞","description":"Ximian Evolution 1.0.x 及更早版本的 camel 组件存在 SSL 证书验证绕过漏洞。当客户端首次建立 SSL 连接并验证证书后，后续在同一会话中建立新的 SSL 连接时，camel 组件未能重新验证服务器证书的有效性。远程攻击者可通过中间人攻击方式，在客户端与服务器之间插入恶意代理，拦截或篡改加密通信内容，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需处于同一网络路径即可实施攻击，无需身份认证，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1471"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:23Z","remediation":"升级 Ximian Evolution 至 1.1.0 或更高版本，该版本在每次建立新 SSL 连接时均强制验证证书链。若无法升级，可在 Evolution 配置中禁用 SSL/TLS 自动连接功能，或使用 stunnel 等工具在客户端与服务器之间建立独立 TLS 隧道，由外部工具接管证书验证逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0045.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10292.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5875","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1471.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1471","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1471.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1471.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p84-cvh4-gvvh/GHSA-5p84-cvh4-gvvh.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146900_147000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--191cc390-b046-472e-b71f-945a4721e380.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1471.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--191cc390-b046-472e-b71f-945a4721e380.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0588","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0588.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1436","title":"Novell NetWare HTTP POST 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5.1 和 6.0 的 Web 服务器使用 Perl 5.003 作为脚本处理程序时存在代码执行漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制 HTTP POST 请求触发该漏洞，在服务器上执行任意 Perl 代码。该漏洞影响运行 Perl 5.003 的 NetWare 5.1/6.0 版本，攻击者无需凭据即可在远端系统执行命令、读取或写入文件，导致服务器被完全控制。Novell 已在后续补丁中修复此问题，升级 Perl 版本或应用官方补丁可消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1436"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:19Z","remediation":"升级 NetWare 集成的 Perl 解释器至 5.6 或更高版本，或安装 Novell 官方安全补丁（TID 2963307）。如无法立即应用补丁，可临时禁用或限制对 Perl CGI 脚本的 HTTP POST 访问，并在防火墙层面过滤外部对 Web 服务器的恶意请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0202.html","http://support.novell.com/servlet/tidfinder/2963307","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9916.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5520","