、0.7.1、0.8.0、0.8.1、0.9.0 及 0.9.1，攻击者可借此获取服务器权限、窃取敏感数据或进一步渗透内网。建议升级至 0.8.2 或更新版本以修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1435"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:19Z","remediation":"建议将 Achievo 升级至 0.8.2 或更高版本（0.8.2 已修复该远程文件包含漏洞）。如无法立即升级，可在 PHP 配置文件 php.ini 中将 allow_url_fopen 设置为 Off，以阻止远程 URL 被当作文件包含；同时需验证 class.atkdateattribute.js.php 中 config_atkroot 参数的输入，确保其仅指向本地路径，不得传入外部 URL。升级完成后重启 Web 服务使配置生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0235.html","http://www.achievo.org/lists/2002/Aug/msg00092.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9947.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5552","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21745","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1435","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2002/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1435.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1435.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1435.json"